WEBVTT

00:05:59.563 --> 00:06:01.524
And the cheetah yelped,

00:06:01.565 --> 00:06:02.900
but there was no water.

00:06:03.234 --> 00:06:06.362
But when the young antelope
asked them to come together

00:06:06.404 --> 00:06:09.448
and build a well, there was water.

00:06:09.990 --> 00:06:11.409
There was a future.

00:06:11.409 --> 00:06:12.618
There was hope.

00:06:13.494 --> 00:06:16.122
This is our young antelope moment.

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:18.749
Let us come together
and let us build a world

00:06:18.791 --> 00:06:23.462
where all young people, all over the world
can flourish and thrive.

00:06:23.504 --> 00:06:24.713
Thank you.

00:06:24.713 --> 00:06:28.342
(Applause)